<title>SYRIA: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP TWO RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIAN ZONE GROUP TWO RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup Asian zone</p>
<p>group two qualifying matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Iran 7 Kyrzygstan 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Karim Bakeri 34, 53, Ferhad Majedi 70, 89, Ali Dae</p>
<p>58, Mehrzad Menavensheen 77, Mosa Devi 84</p>
